{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 43","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is the hypotenuse of a right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />. Median <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and median <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32db217d7630882c3441fa8821cd70a6958c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/454e54ed782b2f35477e73919f6130e66514f120.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5\\sqrt{3}\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\sqrt{2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\sqrt{13}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2\\sqrt{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"474\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cb9c389f40f78d3b29ea7e0bed8376c34c2a12d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import geometry; unitsize(50); pair C = (0,0), B = (3,0), A = (0, 4); pair AC = midpoint(A--C), BC = midpoint(B--C); draw(A--B--C--A); draw(A--C, StickIntervalMarker(2, 1)); draw(B--C, StickIntervalMarker(2, 2)); draw(B--AC); draw(A--BC); dot(AC); dot(BC); MP(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, W); MP(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, E); MP(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, W); MP(&quot;$E$&quot;, AC, W); MP(&quot;$D$&quot;, BC, S); label(&quot;$y$&quot;, A--AC, W); label(&quot;$y$&quot;, AC--C, W); label(&quot;$x$&quot;, B--BC, S); label(&quot;$x$&quot;, BC--C, S); draw(rightanglemark(A, C, B)); [/asy]\" width=\"295\" height=\"365\" />\n</p><p>By the Pythagorean Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f21ed1ad42b7729d9b78f584f8378a45857bba7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^2+y^2=BE^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/0/a60af4b93d7687fd76eff7ea87cd7c4be19722f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+(2y)^2=AD^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2cc90492717a70bc6c0cc12869626a8a411a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2+y^2=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5fe200fafde5d3a09667ea2e54bdd30e74dac300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+4y^2=49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Adding the equations, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/7/5273848219061430d61c26c154e62a3cad1265f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x^2+5y^2=65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, and dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b4bd2f603fdf8008cecc19b4ff57587b62b7802.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>Note that the length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c747d5ce8a5f7908803d050719914dd264e148ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB^2$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/9488bbd1d1bb6068e3e878af798f86127daa97ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^2+(2y)^2=4x^2+4y^2=4(x^2+y^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"306\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/f/83fedf5c090e1c46925a7b031dab7e62014c90e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4(13)}=2\\sqrt{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"126\" height=\"32\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">Problem 42</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">Problem 44</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.p